<title>MOROCCO: Morocco's May consumer prices -0.7 pct, +0.2 yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Morocco's May consumer prices -0.7 pct, +0.2 yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco's Statistics Directorate on Thursday issued the following economic indicators:</p>
<p>    MOROCCO'S CONSUMER PRICES:	 May 97</p>
<p>    Month/month change (pct)	    -0.7</p>
<p>    Year/year change			+0.2</p>
<p>(Base:100 points - 1989)</p>
<p>The monthly inflation drop was attributed mainly to food products index decline, the directorate said.</p>
<p>-- Newsroom +212-7 72 65 18</p>
</text>
